One take-away is that the server doesn’t seem to be case-sensitive, which is not common on Linux webservers. The/static/img/uploadsdirectory seems interesting. It seems to be where profile pictures are stored, like these:


![image-20240114125306061](/img/image-20240114125306061.png)


When I change my avatar, it is stored at/static/img/uploads/14. Nothing else too interesting.

